      "title": "Jira tickets (created by alert_monitor.py)",
      "description": "One row per Jira ticket from the last 7 days, newest first. Click a ticket number to open it in Jira. Ticket status: OPEN until moved to a Done-type status in Jira (checked every 10 s), then CLOSED. Pressure: Pressure High while above the limit, Pressure Low once back below it.",
